&lt;h2&gt;Lifestone v1.0.8 Release Notes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🎵 Hymnal Console Smooth Scrolling &amp; Display Fix&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unconstrained Multi-Directional Scrolling&lt;/strong&gt;: Replaced restricted viewport with native high-performance custom scrollbars across all 260 hymns and unfolded stanzas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Badge &amp; Content Layout&lt;/strong&gt;: Fixed clipping of 'BUILTIN' badge and stanza counts on hymn selection list.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsive Stanza Grid&lt;/strong&gt;: Stanza cards wrap lyrics cleanly with full access to all verses, choruses, and tags on any screen resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
